@startuml
[*] --> Start
Start --> DisplayDashboard : Display dashboard
DisplayDashboard --> [*] : Exit
Start --> AccessTemplates : Access templates
AccessTemplates --> [*] : Exit
Start --> AccessDocumentation : Access documentation
AccessDocumentation --> [*] : Exit
Start --> AccessSupport : Access support
AccessSupport --> [*] : Exit
DisplayDashboard --> UpdateDashboard : Update dashboard
UpdateDashboard --> DisplayDashboard : Return to display
AccessTemplates --> CustomizeTemplates : Customize templates
CustomizeTemplates --> AccessTemplates : Return to access
AccessDocumentation --> ViewDocumentation : View documentation
ViewDocumentation --> AccessDocumentation : Return to access
AccessSupport --> ViewSupport : View support
ViewSupport --> AccessSupport : Return to access
@enduml
